    "reason": "[ev-094d5d8b0291] and [ev-f0f21b325fa6] show the policyexceptions.kyverno.io CRD storage flag moving from v2beta1 (true → false) to v2 (false → true) between 1.12.6 and 1.13.0. The change text says existing objects stay stored as v2beta1 until rewritten and that status.storedVersions must be updated. So the exposed environments are exactly those whose CRD status.storedVersions still contains v2beta1, which is what the proposed resource/field condition checks. Checking whether manifests use the kind or the v2beta1 version (the alternative proposals) would not show which version objects are stored in.",
